# wayland: wl-connect-test connects to the compositor through libwayland
# (libwayland-client, libffi's ffi_call in its dispatcher, and GS1's Wayland
# socket under /svc/wayland), lists the registry's globals and checks for
# wl_compositor, wl_shm and xdg_wm_base. Installed in the wayland-test
# package. Needs the desktop's compositor running and `svc wayland` (its
# list); NOT YET RUN on Jam OS: waits for GS1's socket and PO8's
# tools/ports-test.sh. Built and staged by GP1.
wait 120 Jam OS shell
wait {prompt}
send wl-connect-test
wait connected
wait global
wait wl-connect-test: ok
wait {prompt}
